OL,3,GNEWSANew surgery restores girl's
OL,4,Aparalysed vocal cord
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has undergone a new
OL,7,Fprocedure to restore movement to a
OL,8,Fparalysed vocal cord.
OL,10,FCharlotte, 14, from Higham Ferrers,
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire, is the first patient
OL,12,Fin the region to have laryngeal
OL,13,Freinnervation surgery.
OL,15,FThe operation involves connecting a
OL,16,Fhealthy nerve in the neck to the
OL,17,Fdamaged nerve controlling the voice
OL,18,Fbox.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
