OL,3,GNEWSANew surgery restores girl's
OL,4,Aparalysed vocal cord
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It feels weird but very cool to know
OL,7,Fthat I'm the first person in the East
OL,8,FMidlands to have this procedure," said
OL,9,FCharlotte.
